{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sickly Days and Summer Traces",
    "steam_appid": 3682050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sickly Days and Summer Traces</strong> is a heartwarming pixel-style training RPG developed by the Japanese bishoujo game brand <i>Sister Position</i>. The international release features full HD 1920\u00d71080 resolution and is scheduled for launch in Summer 2025. The game showcases original character designs by <strong>K-ko</strong>, a heartfelt scenario written by <strong>Azumahito</strong>, and production led by <strong>Chata</strong>. Renowned voice actress <strong>Amachi Haru</strong> stars as the heroine, Mirai Asumi.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAs long as we\u2019re together, it\u2019s just like heaven to me.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tucked away in a quiet corner of the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in a peaceful countryside far from the bustle of the city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a brother and sister share gentle, unhurried days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delicate in health, the sister has come to the rural estate to recuperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her brother stays by her side, weaving tender moments into the fabric of summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering dew at dawn,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cloud-watching on lazy afternoons,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >walking home hand in hand at dusk,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and whispering secrets under the stars\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the smallest fragments of time sparkle when shared with someone precious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a delicate tale of companionship and care, of protection and dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time flows slowly through this pastoral setting,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >witness a quiet yet unwavering love quietly bloom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the brother\u2019s shoes and experience life together with your sister;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different scenes and interact with the world around you;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with her, spend time together, care for her, and gradually deepen your bond;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk hand in hand toward a peaceful, happy tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sickly Days and Summer Traces</strong> is a heartwarming pixel-style training RPG developed by the Japanese bishoujo game brand <i>Sister Position</i>. The international release features full HD 1920\u00d71080 resolution and is scheduled for launch in Summer 2025. The game showcases original character designs by <strong>K-ko</strong>, a heartfelt scenario written by <strong>Azumahito</strong>, and production led by <strong>Chata</strong>. Renowned voice actress <strong>Amachi Haru</strong> stars as the heroine, Mirai Asumi.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAs long as we\u2019re together, it\u2019s just like heaven to me.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tucked away in a quiet corner of the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in a peaceful countryside far from the bustle of the city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a brother and sister share gentle, unhurried days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delicate in health, the sister has come to the rural estate to recuperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her brother stays by her side, weaving tender moments into the fabric of summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering dew at dawn,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cloud-watching on lazy afternoons,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >walking home hand in hand at dusk,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and whispering secrets under the stars\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the smallest fragments of time sparkle when shared with someone precious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a delicate tale of companionship and care, of protection and dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time flows slowly through this pastoral setting,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >witness a quiet yet unwavering love quietly bloom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the brother\u2019s shoes and experience life together with your sister;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different scenes and interact with the world around you;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with her, spend time together, care for her, and gradually deepen your bond;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk hand in hand toward a peaceful, happy tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A devoted brother and his fragile sister share a quiet, dreamlike summer. As her gentle companion, speak with her, care for her, and gather the fleeting, precious fragments of a love that blooms softly in the stillness of everyday life.",
